    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614380/extras/2270fcb49e6924bceb4c81fe4c7db20e.avif?t=1752445443\" data-has-big width=800 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614380/extras/4544be41f154579129e3bf76613e778a.poster.avif?t=1752445443\" width=716 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614380/extras/4544be41f154579129e3bf76613e778a.webm?t=1752445443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Martha's Dolls is a first-person horror game where you play as a player who has ventured into an abandoned village rumored to be cursed by the haunted dolls of an old woman named Martha. The village is full of these dolls, and those who enter the village are never able to leave. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to investigate the village and uncover the secrets behind Martha's dolls and the curse that plagues the village. However, you must be careful, as the dolls are not to be underestimated. They are said to be possessed by Martha's vengeful spirit, and they will stop at nothing to protect their village and its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the village, you will encounter a variety of different dolls, each with its own unique abilities and behaviors. Some dolls will simply wander the village, while others will actively hunt you down. You will need to use your wits and survival skills to avoid the dolls and stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the dolls, you will also need to be wary of the village itself. The village is full of traps and hazards, and it is easy to get lost in its maze-like streets. You will need to carefully navigate the village and avoid the traps in order to find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Martha's Dolls is a challenging and suspenseful horror game that will test your nerves. If you are looking for a truly terrifying experience, then Martha's Dolls is the game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614380/extras/2b5f92138a00f07b664797797fbdc3de.avif?t=1752445443\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are some of the features of Martha's Dolls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Variety of different dolls, each with its own unique abilities and behaviors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenging and suspenseful horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Maze-like village full of traps and hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dark and atmospheric world to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gripping story to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic Horror Experience !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- All what you need ( Inventory System , Player Items , Puzzles ...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are a fan of horror games, then Martha's Dolls is a must-play. It is a truly terrifying and unforgettable experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614380/extras/2270fcb49e6924bceb4c81fe4c7db20e.avif?t=1752445443\" data-has-big width=800 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614380/extras/4544be41f154579129e3bf76613e778a.poster.avif?t=1752445443\" width=716 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614380/extras/4544be41f154579129e3bf76613e778a.webm?t=1752445443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Martha's Dolls is a first-person horror game where you play as a player who has ventured into an abandoned village rumored to be cursed by the haunted dolls of an old woman named Martha. The village is full of these dolls, and those who enter the village are never able to leave. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to investigate the village and uncover the secrets behind Martha's dolls and the curse that plagues the village. However, you must be careful, as the dolls are not to be underestimated. They are said to be possessed by Martha's vengeful spirit, and they will stop at nothing to protect their village and its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the village, you will encounter a variety of different dolls, each with its own unique abilities and behaviors. Some dolls will simply wander the village, while others will actively hunt you down. You will need to use your wits and survival skills to avoid the dolls and stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the dolls, you will also need to be wary of the village itself. The village is full of traps and hazards, and it is easy to get lost in its maze-like streets. You will need to carefully navigate the village and avoid the traps in order to find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Martha's Dolls is a challenging and suspenseful horror game that will test your nerves. If you are looking for a truly terrifying experience, then Martha's Dolls is the game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614380/extras/2b5f92138a00f07b664797797fbdc3de.avif?t=1752445443\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are some of the features of Martha's Dolls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Variety of different dolls, each with its own unique abilities and behaviors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenging and suspenseful horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Maze-like village full of traps and hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dark and atmospheric world to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gripping story to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic Horror Experience !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- All what you need ( Inventory System , Player Items , Puzzles ...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are a fan of horror games, then Martha's Dolls is a must-play. It is a truly terrifying and unforgettable experience.</p>",
